      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "2",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I exhort therefore, first of all, that supplications, prayers, intercessions, thanksgivings, be made for all men; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for kings and all that are in high place; that we may lead a tranquil and quiet life in all godliness and gravity. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This is good and acceptable in the sight of God our Saviour; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "who would have all men to be saved, and come to the knowledge of the truth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For there is one God, one mediator also between God and men, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " man, Christ Jesus, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "who gave himself a ransom for all; the testimony ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " in its own times; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "whereunto I was appointed a preacher and an apostle (I speak the truth, I lie not), a teacher of the Gentiles in faith and truth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I desire therefore that the men pray in every place, lifting up holy hands, without wrath and disputing. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In like manner, that women adorn themselves in modest apparel, with shamefastness and sobriety; not with braided hair, and gold or pearls or costly raiment; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but (which becometh women professing godliness) through good works. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let a woman learn in quietness with all subjection. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But I permit not a woman to teach, nor to have dominion over a man, but to be in quietness. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For Adam was first formed, then Eve; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and Adam was not beguiled, but the woman being beguiled hath fallen into transgression: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but she shall be saved through her child-bearing, if they continue in faith and love and sanctification with sobriety.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
